## How to run

### Frontend (Streamlit)
```bash
cd app/frontend
streamlit run streamlit_app.py
```

### Backend (FastAPI)
```bash
cd app/backend
uvicorn main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

### Combined Development
```bash
# Terminal 1: Backend
cd app/backend && uvicorn main:app --reload

# Terminal 2: Frontend
cd app/frontend && streamlit run streamlit_app.py
```

### Production Deployment
```bash
# Use the provided Docker setup
cd app/deploy
docker-compose up -d
```

